function union over T takes unique list of T left with unique list of T right returns unique list of T is
    constant result is empty unique list of T
    repeat with x in left
        add x to result
    end repeat
    repeat with x in right
        add x to result
    end repeat
    return result
end function

constant nums is the result of union unique list of 1, 2 with unique list of 2, 3
say nums
constant words is the result of union unique list of "a", "b" with unique list of "b", "c"
say words
